Very long comment line
* bench.id: cap_lang_syn_long_comment
* bench.group: capability
* bench.title: a 20000-character comment line and a 2000-character trailing comment next to a divider
* bench.probes: v(out)
* bench.tags: linear, op, syntax, long_line
